      "zh": "按明确交易意图选择市价单、限价单与停止单"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This coursework evaluates how a learner explains, analyses and demonstrates choosing market, limit and stop orders for defined trade intent using objective chart evidence, explicit invalidation and controlled risk.",
      "zh": "本课程作业评估学习者如何运用客观图表证据、明确失效条件与受控风险来解释、分析并展示按明确交易意图选择市价单、限价单与停止单。"
    },
