        "Apply choosing market, limit and stop orders for defined trade intent to chart evidence without promising a trading outcome.",
        "Document invalidation and risk controls before demonstrating the skill."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "解释按明确交易意图选择市价单、限价单与停止单背后的核心决策规则。",
