      "title": {
        "en": "Practical Demonstration: order types",
        "zh": "实践展示：按明确交易意图选择市价单、限价单与停止单"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Using a demo account, TradingView, FXReplay, MT5 demo or another approved charting platform, demonstrate choosing market, limit and stop orders for defined trade intent. Annotate the evidence, entry condition, invalidation, stop loss, take profit and risk control, then explain why the demonstration follows the written rules.",
        "zh": "使用模拟账户、TradingView、FXReplay、MT5模拟版或其他获准图表平台展示按明确交易意图选择市价单、限价单与停止单。标注证据、入场条件、失效条件、止损、止盈与风险控制，并解释该展示为何符合书面规则。"
      },
